# The TARS Authors

The copyright of this repository is held jointly by the following authors:

- Arthur Oliveira
- Gustavo Alexandre
- Gildo Alves

TARS is an independent open-source project: its copyright belongs to the
individual authors listed above. The authors are affiliated with the
Universidade Federal do Cariri (UFCA), where the project is studied and
evaluated in academic research (see the companion tars-research repository).
UFCA is credited as the authors' affiliation and research home; it is not a
copyright holder of this repository.

Authors are listed by real, committed contribution, as recorded in the
repository history. Contributors who hold copyright in substantial parts of the
repository are added to this list as their work lands.
